      "text": "GET /portfolio → PortfolioState\nGET /agents/latest?symbol=\nGET /watchlist → { symbol }[]\n─────────────────────────\ncash / equity / P&L KPI tiles\nvalue-over-time chart (Recharts)\npositions table\n─────────────────────────\nAgent Activity card:\n  direction badge (colored)\n  confidence meter (0–100%)\n  rationale verbatim\n  evidence disclosure\n─────────────────────────\n@tanstack/react-query\nloading / empty / error states",
